Write a program to implement matplotlib and pandas libraries in python

#ALGORITHM:- 
Step 1: Start
Step 2: Import Pandas and Matplotlib
Step 3: Create student data (name and marks)
Step 4: Convert data into DataFrame
Step 5: Display DataFrame
Step 6: Use Matplotlib to create bar graph
Step 7: Set labels for X-axis and Y-axis
Step 8: Give title to graph
Step 9: Display the graph
Step 10: Stop


#CODE
import pandas as pd
import matplotlib.pyplot as plt

data = {
    "Name": ["Sajan", "Yadav", "Yashu", "Sanu"],
    "Marks": [85, 92, 78, 88]
}
df = pd.DataFrame(data)
print("DataFrame:\n", df)

plt.bar(df["Name"], df["Marks"])
plt.xlabel("Student Name")
plt.ylabel("Marks")
plt.title("Report Card")

plt.show()

